<div class="blockquote">
<p><strong>CLASS-D:</strong> [D-4546E]</p>
<p><strong>Researcher:</strong> [Dr Nadiva Raghe]</p>
<p><strong>Foreword:</strong> [Testing if a physical barrier that blocks line of sight between entity and subject will stop the anomalous effects]</p>
<p><strong>&lt;Begin Log, [12:15]&gt;</strong></p>
<p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> [D-4546E please proceed into the cell and make sure to keep that riot shield in front of you at all times.]</p>
<p><strong>CLASS-D:</strong> [Yes Dr, now what exactly does this SCP do?]</p>
<p><strong>Researcher:</strong> [Thats not for you to know, now enter the cell as instructed.]</p>
<p><strong>CLASS-D:</strong> [So am I supposed to be looking for something happening? Or some changes in the room?]</p>
<p><strong>Researcher:</strong> [D-4546E please position your body camera so I can observe the SCP.]</p>
<p><strong>CLASS-D:</strong> [As you wish.]</p>
<p><strong>CLASS-D:</strong> [It appears to be rolling itself, is this normal behaviour?]</p>
<p><strong>Researcher:</strong> [Yes, now no more questions!]</p>
<p><strong>CLASS-D:</strong> [Okay&#8230;]</p>
<p><strong>Researcher:</strong> [D-4546E please can you tell me what number appears on the top of the dice?]</p>
<p><strong>CLASS-D:</strong> [A five, is that nor-]</p>
<p><strong>CLASS-D</strong> [Sorry, no more questions]</p>
<p><strong>Researcher:</strong> [Nothing appears to be happening around you?]</p>
<p><strong>CLASS-D:</strong> [No, but I am starting to feel a little strange.]</p>
<p><strong>Researcher:</strong> [I'll get security to escort you to a medical room where we can issue a full-body scan]</p>
<p><strong>CLASS-D:</strong> [AHHHh! Whats happened to me?!? I think my bones have melted!]</p>
<p><strong>Researcher:</strong> [Please D-4546E remain calm. I'm calling a medical team to come and collect you for now please remain calm.]</p>
