<p><strong>Researcher:</strong> [Thank you, now please bring D-4546E to a medical bay to receive a full-body scan. D-4546E: Casualties: Liquidized bones]</p>
<p><strong>&lt;End Log, [12:21]&gt;</strong></p>
<p><strong>Closing Statement:</strong> [Test unsuccessful however we now think that the higher the roll of the dice the more dangerous effects take place on the subject. However, more tests are required to prove that theory. It must also be noted that the security guard who tranquillized D-4546E had previously come in contact with SCP-5232 and had survived with only a broken leg as a casualty]</p>
